      "name": "Upsert AutoCRM Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1180, 40],
      "notes": "VERIFIED against backend source (app/services/import_service.py:286). /api/leads/ingest, NOT /api/leads/ -- ingest_lead_payload() accepts full_name as an alias for name, UPSERTS by email, auto-creates the organization from company, and turns a `notes` key into a lead note. That is why this single call replaces the old Create Lead + Attach Note pair. Note insert dedupes on exact content, so a replayed webhook writes nothing. Do NOT send `score`: LeadCreate.score is int 0-100, not 'hot'/'warm'/'cold', and the backend recalculates it anyway. status must be one of new/contacted/nurture/qualified/unqualified/junk (app/utils/statuses.py). No trailing slash on this path.",
